@page "/"

<PageTitle>Home</PageTitle>

<h1>Blazor Server + Electron.NET</h1>

<p>
    This sample shows how to structure a Blazor Server app that runs in Electron, and how the different parts work together.
    Everything below runs in a single .NET process:
</p>

<div class="cards">
    <div class="card">
        <h2><NavLink href="interactivity">Interactivity</NavLink></h2>
        <p>
            Plain Blazor: components handle events and re-render via the SignalR connection to the Electron window.
            JS interop covers what only the browser can do. Nothing here depends on Electron.
        </p>
        <p><code>Components/Pages/Interactivity.razor</code></p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h2><NavLink href="window">Window Control</NavLink></h2>
        <p>
            Components control the Electron window through <code>WindowService</code>, and window events
            (focus, maximize) flow back into the UI through <code>AppEvents</code>.
        </p>
        <p><code>Desktop/WindowService.cs</code></p>
    </div>
    <div class="card">
        <h2><NavLink href="native">Native Capabilities</NavLink></h2>
        <p>
            Native dialogs, notifications, clipboard and shell via <code>NativeService</code>.
            Files are read directly by .NET - no detour through the renderer.
        </p>
        <p><code>Desktop/NativeService.cs</code></p>
    </div>
</div>

<h2>How it fits together</h2>
<pre class="diagram">
 Electron window (renderer)          .NET process
┌──────────────────────────┐        ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ HTML rendered by Blazor  │◄──────►│ Components (Pages, Layout)                    │
│ blazor.web.js            │ SignalR│   │ inject                     ▲ subscribe    │
└──────────────────────────┘        │   ▼                            │              │
                                    │ WindowService / NativeService  AppEvents      │
 Electron main process              │   │ Electron.*                 ▲              │
┌──────────────────────────┐        │   ▼                            │              │
│ windows, menus, dialogs, │◄──────►│ Electron.NET API ──── events ──┘              │
│ notifications, ...       │ socket │ (ElectronStartup: window + application menu)  │
└──────────────────────────┘        └───────────────────────────────────────────────┘
</pre>

<p>Try the application menu (e.g., <kbd>Ctrl</kbd>/<kbd>Cmd</kbd> + <kbd>2</kbd>): the click is handled in .NET and turned into a Blazor navigation.</p>
